{"version":1,"content":"<p>許紹雄（Benz）於去年10月28日病逝，今天（28日）適逢其離世一周年之際，其女兒許惠菁（Charmaine）於社交平台上載了一條由許紹雄契女劉思葭以AI製作的致敬短片，片中許紹雄化身為主角，向大眾分享過去一年在「彼岸」的生活情况，藉此慰藉關心他的家人與影迷。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T11:21:23.831250+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T10:45:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T02:58:24.304226+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T11:18:12.956755+00:00","content_hash":"9c3acb63ffc21234f529861a3c6138c22929e5d95892ec761040530e28ed861b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}